      "controls": {},
      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Blur averages the pixels around each one, so the dots go soft. Its Blur X and Blur Y are swung by the Oscillator together; set them apart, say Blur X at 20 and Blur Y at 0, for a sideways smear. Size is how far each sample reaches: a bigger kernel is smoother and costs more."
        }
      },
      "width": 380.0
